WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:10.810
Hi, I am a balloon.

2
00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:14.169
Have you ever wondered where balloons come from?

3
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:17.120
Well, today is your lucky day.

4
00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:20.828
I am going to give you a tour of a balloon factory.

5
00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:24.026
Come with me!

6
00:00:24.027 --> 00:00:26.282
Look at all these colors.

7
00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:31.718
In this factory, they make 25 different colored balloons.

8
00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:35.618
Do you think you can name 25 different colors?

9
00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:39.691
Try it! It's not easy.

10
00:00:39.692 --> 00:00:41.841
Where should I begin?

11
00:00:41.842 --> 00:00:45.480
I guess the best place to start is at the beginning.

12
00:00:45.481 --> 00:00:54.716
In this room, the workers prepare all the ingredients that we need to make balloons.

13
00:00:54.717 --> 00:00:57.751
This white goo is called latex.

14
00:00:57.752 --> 00:01:00.372
This is what all balloons are made of.

15
00:01:00.373 --> 00:01:08.673
It doesn't have any color yet, but it soon will.

16
00:01:08.674 --> 00:01:11.216
Now let's go to the production line.

17
00:01:11.217 --> 00:01:15.273
This is where the gooey mixture is turned into balloons.

18
00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:19.541
In this factory, they make many kinds of balloons:

19
00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:27.629
long balloons, round balloons, small balloons, and multicolored balloons.

20
00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:30.310
Let's look at some of the machines.

21
00:01:30.311 --> 00:01:33.511
This machine gives each balloon its shape.

22
00:01:33.512 --> 00:01:37.825
This machine heats the balloons until they are dry.

23
00:01:37.826 --> 00:01:44.316
Then, that machine removes the balloons and puts them into bins.

24
00:01:44.317 --> 00:01:46.720
This is a big factory.

25
00:01:46.721 --> 00:01:50.707
Can you guess how many balloons it makes each day?

26
00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:54.410
One thousand? One hundred thousand?

27
00:01:54.411 --> 00:02:01.980
This factory makes one million balloons a day!

28
00:02:01.981 --> 00:02:08.904
Oh no! One of the machines is broken and the production line has stopped.

29
00:02:08.905 --> 00:02:11.094
This is very bad.

30
00:02:11.095 --> 00:02:12.624
But not to worry!

31
00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:19.205
The repairman will fix it in just a minute.

32
00:02:19.206 --> 00:02:22.033
The repairman must work fast.

33
00:02:22.034 --> 00:02:29.009
If he doesn't, people may not have balloons for their birthdays or picnics.

34
00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:33.329
In this factory, all the balloons must be perfect.

35
00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:37.230
This woman makes sure that every balloon is good.

36
00:02:37.231 --> 00:02:44.548
She makes sure the color, weight, and shape of each balloon is just right.

37
00:02:44.549 --> 00:02:47.883
The next room is very bright and colorful.

38
00:02:47.884 --> 00:02:50.404
Look at all the balloons!

39
00:02:50.405 --> 00:02:54.232
Here the workers stamp words onto the balloons.

40
00:02:54.233 --> 00:02:57.824
She is stamping "Happy Birthday."

41
00:02:57.825 --> 00:03:03.659
Over there, he is stamping "Happy Halloween."

42
00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:11.015
Last stop! In this room, the workers sort the balloons and put them into small bags.

43
00:03:11.016 --> 00:03:14.107
The men put the balloons onto the truck.

44
00:03:14.108 --> 00:03:22.173
The balloons are ready to go to the stores.

45
00:03:22.174 --> 00:03:27.216
Well, I had fun telling you all about the balloon factory.

46
00:03:27.217 --> 00:03:32.729
I hope you had fun too!
